@startuml
title UC-16 workload catalog — ADR-025 (implementation in progress)
autonumber
actor Developer
boundary "Application home" as Home
boundary "Template Dialog / editor" as UI
control "Template catalog" as Catalog
control "Workload configuration" as Config
database "Draft / deployment set JSONB" as Store
control "Planner / renderer" as Runtime
Developer -> Home: Add Workload
Home -> UI: Open picker
UI -> Catalog: Scoped immutable template versions
Catalog --> UI: Schema/defaults/capabilities
Developer -> UI: Select template; configure
UI -> Config: Save desired Score + workloadExecution v1
Config -> Config: Validate immutable catalog pin, runtime, schedule, mount refs
Config -> Store: CAS draft
Store --> Home: Pending
Developer -> Home: Preview
Home -> Runtime: Pin desired/template/renderer/dependencies
alt Capability not implemented/verified
 Runtime --> Home: Renderer unavailable before provisioning
else Capability supported
 Runtime -> Runtime: Plan dependencies / safe manifest review
 Runtime --> Home: Review token
 Developer -> Home: Deploy
 Home -> Runtime: Admit exact token and execute
 Runtime -> Store: Applied snapshot + immutable extension
end
Developer -> Home: Edit
Home -> Config: Reconstruct applied Score
Config -> Store: Read module spec execution
Config --> UI: Lossless execution pin/policy
Developer -> Home: Job history
Home -> Runtime: Scoped applied inventory read
Runtime -> Runtime: Verify deployment owner + CronJob UID -> Jobs
Runtime --> Home: Bounded observed outcomes
@enduml
